    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2"
    },
    {
        "text": "They're the ones who escaped from the central area! Don't let them get away!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tsk, they just keep coming after us!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "Team E2, prepare to intercept--",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dobermann, don't get overzealous. Retreating is our top priority!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya, Dr. {@nickname}! Quick!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_soldiersrun",
        "volume": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not safe here either.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's right. We still have to press on to the next rendezvous point.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where's your team?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where are you rats hiding? Smoke them out!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "text": "Here they come again!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dr. {@nickname}, please give us your orders.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just like the good ol' days.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "......?",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Um, Ace...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Actually, something unexpected has happened.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor... is suffering from amnesia.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "name2": "char_014_riope",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...I see.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sorry, Ace... But compared to before, a lot has changed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "name2": "char_014_riope",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Is that so? You don't need to apologize to me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
    {
        "text": "Have the Doctor's commanding capabilities suffered as a result of the amnesia?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_014_riope",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...As sharp as before.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor's decisionmaking is still absolutely reliable. I can promise you this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_014_riope",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Very well then. I'll follow the Doctor's orders then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
    {
        "text": "What has been lost can be found again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right now, there's a more imminent problem on our hands.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
