    {
        "text": "An ambush?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "text": "Team E3 has been moving undercover this whole time... I see, they've been waiting for us to pincer the enemy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope"
    },
    {
        "text": "When communications are jammed, our teams should operate near the rendezvous point. That way, even if something happens to me or the scout...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
    {
        "text": "The broader operation can still be carried out. This is my decision-making.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "text": "In other words, Ace, you left your team back at the rendezvous point and came here alone...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope"
    },
    {
        "text": "After all, neutralizing threats around the rendezvous point is our top objective.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course, prioritizing checking on your status is a big risk. There's no way I could imperil the entire team.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
    {
        "text": "The whole reason teams exist is to increase tactical efficiency, not the other way around.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah. Let's continue our discussion after we've taken care of Reunion!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya, you're up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Understood! I'll back you up with my Arts!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope"
    },
    {
        "text": "Finally...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dr. {@nickname}, please command Rhodes Island.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
